# Public settings for production builds, committed on purpose.
#
# Vercel won't save these in its dashboard: its "Sensitive" rule refuses a
# VITE_ name, since Vite builds every VITE_ value into the site where anyone
# can read it. Nothing here is secret. Never put a key or password in this
# file: it's in git and ends up in the browser.
#
# Values set in Vercel's dashboard win over this file.

# App only: the landing site, linked from About Us for its roadmap.
VITE_LANDING_URL=https://pillars-azure.vercel.app

# App and landing: Cloudflare Turnstile's site key (public; the secret key
# lives only in Supabase). Turns on CAPTCHA for sign-up, sign-in, the code and
# reset emails, and the waitlist. See TODO.md, Security.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAFDtqS4xIaiStey1
